{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X部分屏幕的感受词过密、近义表达重复，拆句也让个别段落不如Y连贯顺口；Y的完整叙述在自然连读上更好。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，X的短句分层、关键词加亮和感受词随音乐分时出现，让我更容易在不持续盯屏的情况下抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化，也更容易把音乐细节和情绪转折对应起来。尤其是从舍不得、怀疑离开的决定，到意识到自己怀念的是被当作自己人的亲近，再到决定带着想念继续生活，X把人物为什么动摇、为什么不回头交代得更具体，前后也形成了清楚的心理递进。Y的完整句子读起来更顺，但右侧短词堆叠较多，部分表达偏概括，音乐中细微的情绪变化容易被压成几个情绪标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "eb8c0a4e-7579-4235-9180-03f87de1057f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T194836238464Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:49:23.784208+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "51e0e9e25cafcf6027a6ccd6d69ca1843afde9bc40710e0726db4326572b26b6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4